### Create Site
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sites
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "siteName": "Main Construction Site",
  "location": "Colombo",
  "status": "Active"
}


### Get All Sites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sites


### Get Site By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sites/1